t-medium mb-1\">Safe &amp; secure</h3><p class=\"text-meet-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">All meetings are encrypted in transit so your video calls stay private.</p></div><div class=\"bg-meet-surface border border-meet-elevated rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-meet-border transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3\" style=\"background-color:#fbbc0422\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\" style=\"color:#fbbc04\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-meet-text font-medium mb-1\">High performance</h3><p class=\"text-meet-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Adaptive codec &amp; bitrate optimisation ensures crystal-clear video.</p></div><div class=\"bg-meet-surface border border-meet-elevated rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-meet-border transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3\" style=\"background-color:#34a85322\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" style=\"color:#34a853\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-meet-text font-medium mb-1\">Up to 100 participants</h3><p class=\"text-meet-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Host large team meetings, all-hands, or small syncs — same great experience.</p></div><div class=\"bg-meet-surface border border-meet-elevated rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-meet-border transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3\" style=\"background-color:#ea433522\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor-up\" style=\"color:#ea4335\"><path d=\"m9 10 3-3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 13V7\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 17v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-meet-text font-medium mb-1\">Screen sharing</h3><p class=\"text-meet-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Share your entire screen, a specific window, or just a browser tab.</p></div><div class=\"bg-meet-surface border border-meet-elevated rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-meet-border transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3\" style=\"background-color:#aa00ff22\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square\" style=\"color:#aa00ff\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-meet-text font-medium mb-1\">In-call chat</h3><p class=\"text-meet-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Share links, notes, and ideas in real time without interrupting the call.</p></div><div class=\"bg-meet-surface border border-meet-elevated rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-meet-border transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3\" style=\"background-color:#00bcd422\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stro